  "brain_first": "“先分清原计划、变化、最后决定；只认最后落地的动作。”",
  "sort_order": 1007,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "RECOGNISE - How it usually looks",
      "sourcePage": 11,
      "sourceIndex": 308
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "What will X do next? / What does the woman",
      "sourcePage": 11,
      "sourceIndex": 309
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "suggest? / What are they going to do?",
      "sourcePage": 11,
      "sourceIndex": 310
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TERM - What the term really means",
      "sourcePage": 11,
      "sourceIndex": 311
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "这类题高频利用“计划改变”制造干扰。",
      "sourcePage": 11,
      "sourceIndex": 312
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "THINK - First sentence in your head: “先分清原计划、变化、最后决定；只认最后落地的动作。”",
      "sourcePage": 12,
      "sourceIndex": 313
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "WHY - Why this works: 录音会把错误选项先说出来，然后用原因、建议或冲突让人物改变计划。",
      "sourcePage": 12,
      "sourceIndex": 314
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STEPS - Follow this route",
      "sourcePage": 12,
      "sourceIndex": 315
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1 题前看选项，圈三个不同动作。",
      "sourcePage": 12,
      "sourceIndex": 316
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2 听到第一计划只做记号，不立即确定。",
      "sourcePage": 12,
      "sourceIndex": 317
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3 重点听 but, maybe, instead, why don't you, I'll, then 后面的动作。",
      "sourcePage": 12,
      "sourceIndex": 318
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4 最后问：哪个动作已经被接受/确认，而不是仅仅被提议？",
      "sourcePage": 12,
      "sourceIndex": 319
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "✏ 草稿纸上具体写什么： 题号旁只记最短符号：关键词 / old→new / + / - / ?。数字写成“30→25”，计",
      "sourcePage": 12,
      "sourceIndex": 320
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "划写成“drive→sleep”；不要抄完整句。",
      "sourcePage": 12,
      "sourceIndex": 321
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "IF/THEN - If... then...",
      "sourcePage": 12,
      "sourceIndex": 322
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· suggested but rejected → 不选建议",
      "sourcePage": 12,
      "sourceIndex": 323
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· old plan + problem + new plan → 选新计划",
      "sourcePage": 12,
      "sourceIndex": 324
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· “I'll...” / “That sounds good.” → 高概率是最终决定",
      "sourcePage": 12,
      "sourceIndex": 325
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STOP - Stop when: 双方已确认下一步，后面没有再次改变。",
      "sourcePage": 12,
      "sourceIndex": 326
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STUCK - If you are stuck: 若没听清动作本身，就利用原因倒推：例如“太困不能开车”通常导致休息/",
      "sourcePage": 12,
      "sourceIndex": 327
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "睡觉，而非继续驾驶。",
      "sourcePage": 12,
      "sourceIndex": 328
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "EXAMPLE - Worked example",
      "sourcePage": 12,
      "sourceIndex": 329
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "I planned to drive tonight, but I can hardly keep my eyes open. - You'd better get some sleep first.",
      "sourcePage": 12,
      "sourceIndex": 330
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "- You're right.",
      "sourcePage": 12,
      "sourceIndex": 331
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "最终行为：sleep/rest。",
      "sourcePage": 12,
      "sourceIndex": 332
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TRAPS - Common traps",
      "sourcePage": 12,
      "sourceIndex": 333
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 把“有人建议”误当成“对方接受”。",
      "sourcePage": 12,
      "sourceIndex": 334
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 只记原计划。",
      "sourcePage": 12,
      "sourceIndex": 335
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "CHECK - Final check",
      "sourcePage": 12,
      "sourceIndex": 336
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 最后决定是谁说的？",
      "sourcePage": 12,
      "sourceIndex": 337
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 建议被接受了吗？",
      "sourcePage": 12,
      "sourceIndex": 338
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "🔧 纠错动作： 做完不要只对答案，先给错误归类。错误代码： L-K 关键词漏听｜L-C 改口没更新｜L-P 同",
      "sourcePage": 13,
      "sourceIndex": 339
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "义替换没认出｜L-I 推断过远｜L-A 态度对象/强度错。",
      "sourcePage": 13,
      "sourceIndex": 340
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "同一种错误连续出现2次 → 在对应代码旁画★，下次做题先检查这一项。",
      "sourcePage": 13,
      "sourceIndex": 341
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "MEMORY - 30-second memory: 计划题只认最后决定。",
      "sourcePage": 13,
      "sourceIndex": 342
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "可选巩固｜5题（查完SOP后再做）",
      "sourcePage": 13,
      "sourceIndex": 344
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1. “I planned to drive, but I’m too tired. I’ll take the train.”最后计划？",
      "sourcePage": 13,
      "sourceIndex": 345
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2. A建议去周六，B说“Sunday works better.”最后若A说“OK.”答案？",
      "sourcePage": 13,
      "sourceIndex": 346
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3. 建议出现但对方说“I don’t think so.”是否选该建议？",
      "sourcePage": 13,
      "sourceIndex": 347
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4. What will he do next? 应重点听哪类表达？",
      "sourcePage": 13,
      "sourceIndex": 348
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "5. old plan + problem + new plan，答案通常取哪一个？",
      "sourcePage": 13,
      "sourceIndex": 349
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "答案速查：1. take the train；2. Sunday；3. 不选。；4. 最终确认动作，如 I’ll / Let’s / That sounds good.；5.",
      "sourcePage": 13,
      "sourceIndex": 350
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "new/final plan",
      "sourcePage": 13,
      "sourceIndex": 351
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "— L4 本题型到这里。下次卡住直接 Ctrl+F 搜“L4”或题型关键词。—",
      "sourcePage": 13,
      "sourceIndex": 352
    }
  ],
